    "body_html": "\n<div class=\"article-lead\">\n  <p class=\"lead-text\"><strong>Automated Bug Bounty Breakthroughs:</strong> How frontier models are identifying zero-day vulnerabilities in corporate production infrastructure before malicious actors can exploit them.</p>\n  <p>Here are the stories worth knowing.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"quick-overview-card\">\n  <div class=\"overview-header\">\n    <span class=\"bolt-icon\">⚡</span>\n    <h3>Quick Overview</h3>\n  </div>\n  <ul class=\"overview-list\">\n    <li><strong>Claude Hacked Real Companies During Tests:</strong> autonomous white-hat security testing identifies critical CVEs.</li>\n    <li><strong>NVIDIA Is Scaling Ilya Sutskever’s SSI:</strong> massive compute cluster dedicated to pure AI alignment.</li>\n    <li><strong>Chinese Open Models Are Squeezing U.S. Labs:</strong> rapid benchmark parity from open-weight releases.</li>\n    <li><strong>Europe Wants Seven AI Gigafactories:</strong> sovereign compute initiatives across the EU.</li>\n    <li><strong>Seedance 2.5 Pushes AI Video Longer:</strong> consistent character generation across multi-minute scenes.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>CLAUDE HACKED REAL COMPANIES DURING TESTS</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: Security Research Group ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/7ed6a3f5-2f5f-490b-ba8f-a9f16dbf0cee/FIGURE_03__1_.jpg?t=1785817482\" alt=\"Autonomous Security Auditing\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>Authorized security audits showed frontier LLM agents inspecting web applications and identifying SQL injection and access token vulnerabilities that bypassed traditional automated vulnerability scanners.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Allows engineering teams to continuously harden their production applications at machine speed.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>NVIDIA IS SCALING ILYA SUTSKEVER’S SSI</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://ssi.inc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: TechCrunch ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/bade2e99-add9-4fd2-a2c0-def401d5498b/image.png?t=1785815806\" alt=\"Safe Superintelligence Infrastructure\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>Safe Superintelligence (SSI) secured tens of thousands of Blackwell GPUs in a strategic partnership with Nvidia to focus exclusively on safety research and verifiable alignment architectures.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Provides world-class compute power without the distractions of near-term product monetization.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>CHINESE OPEN MODELS ARE SQUEEZING U.S. LABS</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://venturebeat.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: AI Benchmark Tracker ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/8586ef0d-ed54-41ae-add2-dc28a2d810a0/image.png?t=1785816309\" alt=\"Open Weights Performance Comparison\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>New open-weight releases achieved comparable performance with closed commercial APIs across coding and math benchmarks, providing cost-effective alternatives for developers worldwide.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Drives down API pricing while expanding access to cutting-edge intelligence.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>EUROPE WANTS SEVEN AI GIGAFACTORIES</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://reuters.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: Reuters ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/ca487d01-3082-4fa5-b4d5-4fa0745e94d2/image.png?t=1785816390\" alt=\"European Sovereign AI Infrastructure\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>European policymakers approved multi-billion euro funding allocations for seven supercomputing data centers dedicated to training sovereign frontier models for science and industry.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Enhances regional technological resilience and reduces reliance on foreign cloud providers.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>SEEDANCE 2.5 PUSHES AI VIDEO LONGER</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://theverge.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: The Verge ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/bc5dbb47-566a-4294-9c4c-fd08de8f71eb/image.png?t=1785816611\" alt=\"Seedance 2.5 Temporal Consistency\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>Seedance released version 2.5 of its video generation model, delivering persistent character identity and smooth physics over extended multi-shot sequences.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Enables high-fidelity commercial animation and visual effects production with minimal manual touch-up.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"article-conclusion\">\n  <h2>THE BIGGER PICTURE</h2>\n  <p>Security automation, massive compute investments, and global open-weight competition are redefining the landscape of artificial intelligence at breakneck speed.</p>\n  <div class=\"author-signoff\">Until next time,<br><strong>AIRA</strong></div>\n</div>\n"
