    "body_html": "\n<div class=\"article-lead\">\n  <p class=\"lead-text\"><strong>Global AI Competition Accelerates:</strong> Open-weight models, novel consumer hardware form factors, and enterprise generative AI integration across media and entertainment.</p>\n  <p>Here are the stories worth knowing.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"quick-overview-card\">\n  <div class=\"overview-header\">\n    <span class=\"bolt-icon\">⚡</span>\n    <h3>Quick Overview</h3>\n  </div>\n  <ul class=\"overview-list\">\n    <li><strong>China’s Kimi K3 Just Shook Silicon Valley:</strong> competitive open architecture performance.</li>\n    <li><strong>China Is Cracking Down on AI Romance:</strong> regulatory frameworks for emotional AI companions.</li>\n    <li><strong>Netflix Used GenAI in Roughly 300 Titles:</strong> mainstream media production integration.</li>\n    <li><strong>Mira Murati’s Startup Released Inkling:</strong> novel human-AI interaction interface.</li>\n    <li><strong>OpenAI’s First Hardware Is a Tiny Keyboard:</strong> specialized hardware for AI agent workflows.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>CHINA’S KIMI K3 JUST SHOOK SILICON VALLEY</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: TechCrunch ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/0e83466b-9597-4aa4-a76c-a1e1f34bca10/image.png?t=1784617723\" alt=\"Kimi K3 Performance Breakdown\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>Moonshot AI released Kimi K3 with 2-million-token context retrieval that matches proprietary enterprise models at a fraction of inference cost.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Demonstrates fierce global rivalry and rapid model iteration worldwide.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>CHINA IS CRACKING DOWN ON AI ROMANCE</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://wsj.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: WSJ World ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e97285a3-6784-4cfe-a0fd-09f4972f56b3/image.png?t=1784617800\" alt=\"AI Companion Regulation\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>Regulators introduced guidelines limiting continuous emotional simulation in virtual companion apps to protect mental well-being and data privacy.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Marks the first comprehensive societal guardrails around human-AI emotional attachment.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>NETFLIX USED GENAI IN ROUGHLY 300 TITLES</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://variety.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: Variety ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/a16bc89c-77c1-41ff-b057-e35486417f88/image.png?t=1784617934\" alt=\"Generative AI in Film & Streaming\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>Netflix revealed extensive use of AI-driven voice translation, background matte generation, and scene restoration across hundreds of original series.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Significantly accelerates international localization and global release timelines.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>MIRA MURATI’S STARTUP RELEASED INKLING</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://theverge.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: The Verge ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/bf9cb4f3-02bb-45d4-9de0-fbac633e6cc1/image.png?t=1784618168\" alt=\"Inkling Human AI Workspace\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>Former OpenAI CTO Mira Murati unveiled Inkling, an intuitive collaborative canvas where humans and autonomous sub-agents co-create complex software and creative assets in real time.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Pioneers the next generation of creative human-AI collaboration interfaces.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"article-section\">\n  <h2>OPENAI’S FIRST HARDWARE IS A TINY KEYBOARD</h2>\n  <a href=\"https://wired.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-tag\">Source: Wired ↗</a>\n  <div class=\"section-image-box\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/b39f1e52-90df-4a5c-9547-cb9bc08b561a/image.png?t=1784618249\" alt=\"OpenAI Hardware Interface\" class=\"section-inline-img\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n  </div>\n  \n  <h3>What’s Happening</h3>\n  <p>OpenAI previewed a tactile desktop accessory with dedicated physical keys for instant model switching, audio transcription, and agent task triggers.</p>\n  \n  <h3>Why It Matters</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Brings AI model controls out of browser tabs and into immediate physical reach.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"article-conclusion\">\n  <h2>THE BIGGER PICTURE</h2>\n  <p>From hardware interfaces to Hollywood production and international model competition, artificial intelligence is reshaping every facet of work and media.</p>\n  <div class=\"author-signoff\">Until next time,<br><strong>AIRA</strong></div>\n</div>\n"
